1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,720
Yana yaldır.

2
00:00:11,827 --> 00:00:12,827
Bunlar.

3
00:00:12,827 --> 00:00:15,468
Yürmey.

4
00:01:07,796 --> 00:01:08,936
